WEBVTT

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.210
Welcome home, Master

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.330
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.290
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.540
Omelet fully loaded with chicken and rice

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.420
Make it yummy, moe moe kyun

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.790
With plenty of milk and plenty of love

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.630
Let's cast a spell, moe moe kyun

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.880
Seeing sooo many masters here makes me so happy, oink!

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.330
Fresh out of Moe Moe Forest

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.960
This maid's going whole hog, oink!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.380
Kawaii is justice, oink!

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.420
My makeup's just the bomb, like, O.M.G.!

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.960
Ramen, extra veggies, topped with sauce, fat, and garlic aplenty

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.170
Welcome home to the pigsty!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.080
Hey! (Yeah!) This is my maid way! (Whoo!)

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.830
Shot through your heart like, Boom! Boom! Boom! (Alright!)

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.790
Take an instax with the scumbag

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.250
Hey! (Yeah!) Maid princesses from Hell! (Whoo!)

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.880
Stan for me or, Blam! Blam! Blam! (Okay)

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.920
Petticoats whirl in a scuffle

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.670
Hide-and-seek at the maid cafe

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.380
Nice service for booming sales

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.170
Falling in love a big no-no

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.500
A cutesy garden of secrets

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:34.500
Crime or Accident?

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:34.500
Police Investigation

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:34.500
Goes Nowhere

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.500
Male Body Found in Kanda River

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.210
In the early hours of this morning,

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:37.500
the body of an unidentified male was found
in the Kanda River in Chiyoda City, Tokyo.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:38.790
Battles Without Moe

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:42.040
The remains were badly mutilated and police are working
to identify the deceased as soon as possible-

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.880
This Year's

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.880
Lady Omoe

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.960
Man, it's busy, so busy.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.880
You could help too, Chief!

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.040
If we don't have enough hands,
we could just hire some new maids!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.670
We can do that?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.460
Well, we're totally raking it in
thanks to the Lady Omoe effect.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.750
It's true, maybe we could add some new maids.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.670
I get to have underlings?

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.920
Oh, welcome back!

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.420
Oka... Oka... Oka...

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.210
It's Okachimachi!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.790
No way...

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.080
That's such a horrible way to go.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.380
Okachimachi's been offed on the "o"...

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.580
The "o"...

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.750
How could they?

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.500
That doesn't spell "Radio" anymore.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:26.210
Radio Building

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.330
It's "Radipanda!"

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.580
It fell?!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.670
The head's empty?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:40.500
You were the one inside the suit?

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.830
You're alive!

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.580
You have something on there.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:51.000
Oinky Doink Cafe is hereby disowned
from the Creatureland Group.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.880
You're kidding!
Show me that!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
DISOWNMENT NOTICE

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
Greetings, we trust that you are all doing well.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
This is to notify you that Oinky Doink Cafe is

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
hereby disowned from the Creatureland Group.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
Oinky Doink Manager: Yasuko Yaegashi

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
Oinky Doink Members: Yume Hiiragi, Shino Ayato,

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.790
Okachimachi, Ranko Mannen, Nagomi Wahira, Zoya

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:54.790
It's legit.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.380
This can't be real.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:59.540
It's just a bad dream, right?

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.460
Damn it! I can't get through!

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:08.000
There's no surviving in Akiba
if we're disowned by the group.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.170
Just when our sales are growing
thanks to the Lady Omoe effect!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.500
Why would they do this?!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.790
Yes, what the hay?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.040
What's going to happen to us?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.330
They'll come for us right away.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.130
Chief, what do we do?!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.250
Don't expect me to answer everything!

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:22.630
Think for yourself for once!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.080
I can't come up with anything!

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.630
Me neither!

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:28.170
We're really pigs now.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:32.170
In this cage we call Akiba,
just waiting for the day we get slaughtered.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:36.040
Man, I didn't plan on dying this young...

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.500
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.500
Yumechi has had plastic surgery.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.960
The pork at Oinky Doink is actually worm meat.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.920
Without a doubt,

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.920
Ranko is a

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.920
forty-year-old pig

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.920
How could they?

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.040
You're still only thirty-six, Ranko.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.460
I'm still filled with doubt all the time.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.420
Nagomin!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.040
Oh, good morning.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.290
The cafe still isn't-

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:01.790
Do you remember Akai?

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:05.880
Yes, the one who was always dressed in red?

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.670
Akai is dead.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.920
You know the body they found in
the Kanda River last week?

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.130
That was Akai.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:14.580
The police say he may have been tortured.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.290
Sounds like a maid did the job.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.330
Wait, what?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:20.420
You're kidding, right?
A maid wouldn't murder a master-

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.880
He bragged about you at other cafes, Nagomin.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.000
Of course the maids there weren't happy about that,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.710
but he was kind of oblivious.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.880
Honestly, we're scared, too.

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:35.210
They might have us pegged as
Oinky Doink Cafe regulars.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.380
Sorry, we can't come home to Oinky Doink anymore!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.670
We can't be fans if we're dead!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.540
Goodbye!

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:52.880
Welcome home to the pigsty...

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:59.210
We're so sorry, our cafe has a strict no maids policy.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.880
What do you mean?

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.380
We're just regular meowstresses.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.330
You're so obviously maids.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.630
I spy some dashing masters over here!

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.420
I hope you don't mind if we join you?

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:10.920
Uh, well...

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.250
Hey, that's mine-

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:14.750
This isn't fit fur drinking!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.880
There are better cafes around that
don't serve this kind of pig slop!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.880
Come on, let's skip this joint.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.080
Uh, no, I...

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.630
Whose master d'ya think you're harassing?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.790
Moo, someone's scary!

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:26.880
Huh?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:27.960
Um, hey!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.710
We have to go soon, actually.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.960
Oh, right!

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.540
I hope you come home again soon!

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.500
Uh, yeah...

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.580
Now this is what a pigsty should look like!

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.790
Why?

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.880
Why would you do this?!

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:47.540
A Dazzlion was supposed to be the next
Lady Omoe at the festival, okay?

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.830
You're the ones who ignored that rule.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.580
It's because I became the next Lady Omoe?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.920
So what if it is?

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.630
Huh?

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.580
If we're disowned, you're an enemy.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.790
Fine by me.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.380
Wanna go?! Huh?!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.790
Ranko?! Why?!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.460
The forty-year-old maid knows what's what.

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:08.420
We'll be back to-meow-row!

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.960
DORAMA

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.960
Ramen

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:16.710
Ranko, why did you stop me?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.670
Ranko, you getting soft on us?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.250
I'm to blame for Oinky Doink getting disowned.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:29.790
I once made an oath of sisterhood with
the current head of the Creatureland Group.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:30.790
What?!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.540
Is that the sister you talked about before?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.380
Yes.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.920
I used to work together with the head.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.040
For real?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.130
For real.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:48.960
In the 1960s, there was a maid named Miss Michiyo
who was a formidable force in Akiba.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:57.330
Maid Teahouse

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:54.380
The place where Oinky Doink Cafe is now used to be
a maid cafe founded by Miss Michiyo,

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.040
called the Maid Teahouse.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:59.920
The head and I worked as maids there.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:05.710
She was the one who taught me everything
back when I had very little experience as a maid.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:12.250
However, we regretfully clashed
over the cafe's policies.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.630
RANKO

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:18.170
I believe the head has disowned our cafe
due to her contempt for me.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:21.210
Pops, load me up.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:30.040
Tomorrow, I shall go settle this properly.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:32.040
You can't go by yourself!

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.460
This is all because I stole the Lady Omoe title!

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:37.420
No, this is between me and the head.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.290
I can't drag the rest of you into it.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:43.420
Why would anybody from our cafe
think you dragged us into this?!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.420
Right?!

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.920
Huh?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.750
We won't ever forget you, Ranko.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.920
You go live out your responsibility.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.380
I shall.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.750
This isn't right!

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:55.960
Don't you all agree?!

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:58.170
But is there any other way?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.000
At this rate, we're all gonna be killed.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.250
You're kidding, right?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.460
We don't have what it takes to protect Ranko.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.040
Though it sucks to admit it.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.420
Zoya?!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:11.420
If we go, that means we undermine Ranko's resolve.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:12.920
Fine, forget it!

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.250
Even if it's just me-

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.460
Are you prepared to die?

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.790
If not, you'll just get in my way.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:35.670
Well then, it will be an early morning for me tomorrow,
so I will take my leave.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.250
Pops, I wish you all the best.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:51.330
Ever since she met you lot,
she really looked like she was enjoying herself.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.710
She's desperate about protecting you all.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.000
Though she doesn't know how to show it.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:22.580
Why?

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.630
You can't go without your star player.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.290
We can't abandon you, y'know?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.920
If we're going to call ourselves mushrooms,
we have to get in the basket!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:31.080
Let's show 'em the power of a true bond.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:33.000
Hey, you objected until the last minute.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.670
You may lose your lives.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.880
Ranko, I'm prepared.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.790
Not prepared to die,

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.670
but to make sure all of us come back
to Oinky Doink together!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.420
All of you...

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.830
Thank you so very-

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.170
How does it look today?

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:01.170
Your skin is glowing in a way
that befits the top of the ecosystem.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:02.170
Good.

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:04.170
Whaddaya think yer doing, punks?!

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.920
Do you have any idea who's behind these doors?!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:15.040
You're coming with us.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.380
Dazzlion

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.380
All right! All of you, out!

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.790
And leave your weapons!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.580
Ignore them and riddle these pigheads
with bullet holes!

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.460
What're y'all standing around for?!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.250
Get the hell out!

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.170
Dazzlion

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.040
If you're going to kill me, do it already.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.540
You're our hostage.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.790
You wusses shouldn't be picking a fight
with the king of beasts!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.790
My horoscope sucked today.
Think I'm gonna die?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.170
Nah, we'll be fine.
Female intuition.

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.540
Yeah, let's go with that.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.290
Creatureland

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.290
Please excuse me!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:57.750
Boss! The swine have taken a hostage
and shut themselves in Dazzlion!

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.500
Kill them.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.080
But you personally manage Dazzlion...

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.290
Kill them.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.170
OK-reature!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:08.880
You.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:09.710
Yes?!

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.630
So many leaving...

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.080
Time to go.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:18.080
Right!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.920
There's like, a ton of them.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.580
Listen up, Creatures!

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:29.580
If you value this lion's life-

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.000
Don't they care about the hostage?!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.500
The hell, man?!

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.750
Good old Miss Nagi!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.880
We're going to hell together, swine!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.080
Don't let them faze you!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.250
We can't let those Creatures near us!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.920
I'll take out the lot of you!

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.790
Creatureland

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.080
No one's here?

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:02.460
Do you think everyone headed over to Dazzlion?

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.540
It says the CEO room is on the top floor.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.830
Ranko Mannen!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:20.880
No way...

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.630
Hand over yer guns.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:31.080
Our head wants to see you.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.500
I wouldn't dream of getting out of here alive.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.580
Please excuse me! I've brought 'em!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.830
Shall we?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:45.830
Yes!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.960
Allow me to return these!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:10.960
I'm so sorry I took the Lady Omoe title!

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:15.080
I never thought I'd win it that easily...

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.130
Get your head up.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.830
Ranko, why are you here?

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:27.920
To ask you to reconsider disowning Oinky Doink.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.000
You're not here to kill me?

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.630
I did want to kill you.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.960
But I realize now I can't do it, Uzuko.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.540
If at all possible, I would rather not kill you, either.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.960
Uzuko...

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.920
Ranko, I'll prepare you a seat among the higher ups.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:51.290
So long as you prove your sincerity.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:57.460
Go kill the pigs at Oinky Doink.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:01.630
I know that you're desperate to protect the pigsty

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:04.670
because you can't get over
what happened Miss Michiyo.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.540
But it's time to let go.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:09.080
From now on, fight to protect me.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.750
I'm sure Miss Michiyo would understand.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:15.250
Working under me will get you everything.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:20.210
Security in Akiba, respect from other maids,
masters with wealth...

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.580
I'll provide you with all of that.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.290
We'll be in the maid business again, together.

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.000
I must apologize.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:30.630
I can't do that.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:32.040
Why not?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:37.420
Oinky Doink Cafe means the world to me.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:45.380
Please, allow me to give my life
in exchange for letting Oinky Doink off the hook!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.000
Ranko!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.630
You promised we would go home together!

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:51.880
I find this hard to believe.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:56.170
Akiba is going to need a maid cafe
like Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:59.250
A cafe that can't even squeeze out sweets money?

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:04.000
I think a sullen-looking person like you
would truly benefit from coming to Oinky Doink.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.960
Be careful with your choice of words.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:12.960
Ranko!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.380
What's so special about the pigsty?

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.130
I enjoy it there.

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:23.630
We all went to the casino together
and played baseball.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:28.250
We held an event on my birthday
and everyone celebrated it with me.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.750
And I've gotten much better at ketchup doodling.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.710
You enjoy it, eh?

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.250
That's good.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.170
You there.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.290
Yes?!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.250
Those crab pincers on your head, lop them off.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.670
Please leave Nagomi out of this!

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:55.500
I will, gladly.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.130
Nagomi! You can't!

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:59.920
Ranko, please let me do my share.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:03.960
Dazzlion

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.330
Zoya!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.330
I'm fine.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.000
But I can't stop the bleeding!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.500
I guess this is it, people.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:18.040
I don't want to watch all of you die.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.880
I'll see you on the other side.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.710
Hey! What the hell are you doing?!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.960
I'm so glad I was a part of Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.330
A manager can't give up that easily!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.330
Ranko and Nagomi are fighting as we speak!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.540
Isn't Oinky Doink your cafe?!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.880
My cafe?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.330
Don't you mess around with my cafe!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.170
Allow me to lop off one of my pigtails!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:52.500
Ranko, is the pigsty special to you
because this maid got under your skin?

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:55.580
What could this maid have to offer?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:57.960
Answer me.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.500
Nagomi reminds me of Miss Michiyo.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.420
Nagomi!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.330
Power is everything in Akiba.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:15.710
A maid with no power has no worth.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:17.630
Uzuko! Don't, please!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:21.420
If we kept listening to Miss Michiyo,
we would have been massacred.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:25.000
You know that now.
That's why you've lived your life killing maids.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:28.630
Make your choice:
Me, or her.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.130
Uzuko!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.330
Ranko!

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:36.630
You can't!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:40.000
Isn't she your one and only sworn sister, Ranko?!

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:42.380
Shoot me, or else she dies.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.330
I can't choose.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.460
You're both precious to me, like family!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:53.920
Uzuko...

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.460
please let us off in exchange for my life!

00:17:58.540 --> 00:17:59.830
Oinky Doink Cafe...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.040
is my home!

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:19.380
You're a grown thirty-six-year-old and you're crying?

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:22.000
Please, I implore you.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:24.460
They're worth shedding tears over?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:25.830
Yes!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.080
You disappoint me.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:30.630
Forget it.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.460
Uh, what do you...

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.460
Squeeze out ten times as much
sweets money going forward.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.460
What?!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.630
Then we're not disowned?

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.580
You'll let us off if we pay
ten times as much sweets money?

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.790
You want to die?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:46.790
I-I'm sorry! We will!
We'll squeeze it out!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:48.580
Uzuko...

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.460
You lot are livestock.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.460
Work your tails off as fodder for the group.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:56.460
Now if that's all, get the hell out.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.130
Please excuse us!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.500
Uzuko...

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.330
come see my work as a maid sometime.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:15.130
Oinky Doink Cafe is hap-pig to serve
as a home to all masters anytime, oink.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.830
As if I would ever go to a pigsty.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:32.130
Listen up, pigs!
I just got word from our head!

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.500
What're you doing?!
Shoot her, now!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.130
B-but she's unarmed!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.330
Fire!

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:38.880
The fighting is over!

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:40.880
Oops...

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:46.130
I got a damn hole in my pouch...

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.540
Dude!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.540
The fighting is over!
Don't shoot!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.750
Don't you shoot!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:19:59.960
Your hair tie...

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.330
It got ruined.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.170
Oh, I can just buy another one!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.250
You're right.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:11.130
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.170
Nagomi!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.170
Ranko!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.080
Hi, everyone!

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.290
You're all alive.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.380
We were this close to dying, though.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:20.710
So what happened?

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.790
She let us off for ten times as much sweets money.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.630
Ten times? For real?

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.580
We've never even paid properly before.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.540
Couldn't you have haggled for less?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.830
No way! The head was terrifying, okay?!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.130
You should be grateful!

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.670
I'll work really hard!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.210
Everyone...

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:41.580
Welcome home, to the pigsty.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.500
Adorable...

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.460
Hmm, I can't decide.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:04.040
This one's cute, but I think this one
would look good on Ranko, too.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.500
Would you like to take that?

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:07.580
Yes.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.130
Could you please wrap it as a gift-

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.580
I think this one might suit Ranko.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.210
Ranko?!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.210
Ranko!

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.790
Ranko! Ranko!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.500
Ranko! Ranko!

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:25.750
Someone...

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.500
Someone, please!

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.880
An ambulance!
Call an ambulance!

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:32.420
Please! Someone call an ambulance!

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:37.420
Ranko?

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.580
I want to be a maid...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.920
Don't talk!

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:44.500
A cute maid...

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:47.290
You're already a wonderful maid, Ranko!

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.210
A maid I really look up to!

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:52.920
I want to keep doing this...

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:56.920
...with all of you...

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:07.250
Ranko...

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:29.630
Another day, another chance to go moe moe kyun

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:36.040
I come to the pigsty for my moe moe kyun

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:42.040
That's the sort of life I lead

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:51.830
Mock me, and you just might bleed

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:57.420
Is the hesitation that wells up

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:06.250
The lingering scent of a humane soul?

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:13.330
Whether you get to live or die

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:19.170
Tread your own path

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:25.540
Have the guts to pull that trigger

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:31.880
Who are you

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:38.790
Show me through the pain
